<title>BELGIUM: Cofinimmo H1 96 group net soars.</title>
<headline>Cofinimmo H1 96 group net soars.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			    719.8 vs 158.2</p>
<p>    Operating				  2,817.2 vs 550.5</p>
<p>    Current pre-tax			  2,646.2 vs 275.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation				 134.6 vs 265.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian property company Cofinimmo said in a statement it was considering paying a 1996 net dividend of 165 francs per share, compared with 76 francs in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
